{
	"SchemaName": "PNC_LineLevel",
	"HeaderRow": 1,
	"//": [
		"PNC 'Line Level' sheet. Mapping per AveragesTable_AllAccounts_Field Mapping_V1.21.xlsx,",
		"LineLevelFactTable, column 'PNC'.",
		"Each column is a source header; where it is not already a COMMON alias, Aliases names the COMMON",
		"column it feeds - a lab-only alias group, so LineLevel.schema.json is unchanged for other labs.",
		"ClinicName <- 'Sales Rep Facility', SalesRepname <- 'Sales Rep', Panelname <- 'Service Type',",
		"CPTCode <- 'CPT / Procedure', ICDCode <- 'Diagnosis Codes' (V1.21).",
		"DenialCode <- 'Denial Code' (declared: the COMMON aliases list 'Claim Level Denial Code' first);",
		"'Updated Denial Code' is appended raw.",
		"'Claim Level CPT' fills the COMMON column of that name (ClaimCPTs) and is deliberately NOT",
		"declared: it is also a COMMON CPTCode alias listed before CPTCode, so declaring it would make it",
		"win over 'CPT / Procedure'. 'Line Level CPT' is the CPT*Units pair (V1.21 'CPTUnits'), appended raw.",
		"'Source' fills the COMMON Source column (the sheet's own value - PNC is a single-sheet lab, so",
		"nothing stamps it).",
		"'Deposit Date' is CheckDate; 'Posted Date' reaches Payment Posted Date through the COMMON alias.",
		"'Write Off' is InsuranceAdjustments and 'Patient Responsibility' is PatientBalance (V1.21).",
		"'Aging' is the DOS aging bucket and is appended raw (the line level has no COMMON 'Aging DOS').",
		"The sheet has no Claim Status; it is copied from the claim sheet (ShouldCopyClaimStatusToLineLevel).",
		"'Status' is the billing system's status and is kept raw."
	],
	"Columns": [
		{ "Name": "Source", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Claim ID", "Aliases": [ "ClaimID" ], "Required": true, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "T/F", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Status", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Service Type", "Aliases": [ "Panelname" ], "Required": true, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Form Type", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Sales Rep", "Aliases": [ "SalesRepname" ], "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Sales Rep Facility", "Aliases": [ "ClinicName" ], "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Patient Name", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Patient Control #", "Aliases": [ "PatientID" ], "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Patient DOB", "Required": true, "DataType": "date" },
		{ "Name": "Patient Gender", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Group Number", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Subscriber Relationship", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Secondary Payer", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Secondary Policy ID", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
		{ "Name": "Secondary Group Number", "Required": false, "DataType": "string" },
